{"The unsubscribe action assumes a `TopicUser` row always exists and directly dereferences it; when no record exists, `find_by` returns nil and calling `notification_level` on it raises `NoMethodError`": 0.9642632603645325, "The `title` value is interpolated directly into an HTML string without escaping, allowing XSS vulnerability if title contains user-controlled content": 0.2725491225719452, "`postStream.closestPostForPostNumber` can return null and immediately dereferencing `closestPost.get('post_number')` will throw a runtime error when that happens": 0.24429838359355927, "The unsubscribe action redirects using `@topic_view.topic.unsubscribe_url` but no such method exists on the topic model, causing undefined method error when slug check fails": 0.028161991387605667, "In the visit tracking method, the `user_id` fallback incorrectly uses the `topic` argument when `user` is not a `User` instance, recording visits under the wrong user": 0.15922226011753082, "The respond instructions placeholder in the HTML template is only replaced when the unsubscribe flag is set, leaving `%{respond_instructions}` placeholder in output for emails without unsubscribe link": 0.6723607182502747}